  "bodyHtml": "<div id=\"cerfitication-container\" class=\"container-fluid lang_rtl\">\n<h1 id=\"about-top-title\" class=\"h1-1\">全球認證</h1>\n<div class=\"cf_link_area\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_1\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_01.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">歐盟壓力容器<br>安全認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_2\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_02.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">NSF飲用水<br>標準認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_3\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_03.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">NSF61<br>飲用水標準認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_4\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_04.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">ISO 9001<br>製造品質管理認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_5\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_05.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">UPC美國管道<br>安全認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_6\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_06.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">KC韓國安全認證<br>&nbsp;</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"row\">\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_7\">\n                        <img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_07.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">ACS<br>法國飲用水容器認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_8\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_08.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">WRAS<br>英國飲用水容器認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"col-xs-4\">\n                    \t<a href=\"/zh/certification#si_9\">\n                    \t<img src=\"/images/CERTIFICATION/icon/img_09_2025.png\" border=\"0\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"\">\n                    \t<p class=\"cf_link_icon_txt\">WaterMark<br>澳洲飲用水容器認證</p>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n             </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n\n    \t<div id=\"cf_area_Asia\" class=\"container cf_area_c\" style=\"\">\n\n                <a name=\"si_1\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/CE.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"CE歐盟壓力容器安全認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/ce_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                CE歐盟壓力容器安全認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>歐盟壓力設備指令2014/68/EU(PED)規定了壓力設備的設計和製造標準，壓力設備通常體積超過一升，最大壓力超過0.5巴表壓。 它還規定了壓力設備&ldquo;合格評定&rdquo;的行政程序要求，以便在沒有當地立法障礙的情況下自由投放歐洲市場。溢康壓力桶全部通過PED認證，並符合PED認證焊工製造。</span></span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.certipedia.com/quality_marks/9108658013?locale=en&certificate_number=01+202+TWN%2FQ-19+0360\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_2\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/NSF58.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"NSF58飲用水標準認證 （NSF/ANSI 58）\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/nsf_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                NSF58飲用水標準認證 （NSF/ANSI 58）                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:\"><span>NSF/ANSI 58</span></span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>確立了點對點（POU）反滲透系統的最低認證要求，這些系統目的在減少可能存在於公共或私人飲用水中的污染物。</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>NSF/ANSI 58</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>的範圍包括材料安全性、結構完整性、總溶解固體（TDS）去除以及其他可選的污染物去除聲明。NSF/ANSI 58最常見的可選聲明包括囊腫的去除、六價和三價鉻的去除、砷的去除、硝酸鹽/亞硝酸鹽的去除，以及鎘和鉛的去除。</span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"http://info.nsf.org/Certified/DWTU/Listings.asp?Company=12210&Standard=058\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_3\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/NSF61-20210207.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"NSF61飲用水標準認證（NSF/ANSI 61）\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/nsf61_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                NSF61飲用水標準認證（NSF/ANSI 61）                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:\"><span>NSF/ANSI 61</span></span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>確保您的產品符合美國和加拿大的監管要求，通常也能滿足其他許多國家的測試要求。市場領導者努力獲得NSF認證，作為卓越的標誌，向客戶保證他們的產品在飲用水中使用是安全的。NSF/ANSI 61測試涵蓋所有與飲用水接觸的產品，從水源到水龍頭，確定您的產品可能從中遷移或滲出哪些污染物進入飲用水。它還確認這些污染物是否低於被認為是安全的最大標準水平。</span></span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://plm.iapmo.org/pld#/certificate/N-7370/1883\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_4\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20241209_EUROCERT-IOS9001.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"ISO 9001製造品質管理認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/eurocert_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                ISO 9001製造品質管理認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>ISO 9001:2015</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>設定了品質管理體系的標準，並且是該系列中唯一可以通過認證的標準（儘管這不是必需的）。它可用於任何組織，無論其規模大小和活動領域。該標準基於多個品質管理原則，包括強調客戶關注、頂層管理的動機和參與、過程方法以及持續改進。</span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/certification_page.php?sid=4\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_5\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/UPC.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"UPC美國管道安全認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/upc_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                UPC美國管道安全認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>UPC</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>認證標記保證了溢康壓力桶的功能和安全性。這些預壓式飲用水壓力桶在桶內的水部分和空氣部分之間有一個屏障。必須依據製造商的說明和最新版本的統一管道規範的要求進行安裝。此證書上列出的產品已經由IAPMO R&amp;T認可的實驗室進行了測試。該認可已被授予。</span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://plm.iapmo.org/pld#/certificate/4837/1882\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_6\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/%E9%9F%93%E6%96%87%E8%AA%8D%E8%AD%89.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"KC韓國安全認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/kc_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                KC韓國安全認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:\"><span>KC</span></span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span >（Korea Certification）標識表示符合韓國對壓力設備的產品安全要求，並由經過韓國標準協會批准的韓國認證機構發布。壓力設備的製造商和經銷商在完成標準程序後，可以在其商品上貼上KC標識。這個標識表示產品符合韓國相關的安全標準要求，可以在韓國市場上合法銷售和使用。</span></span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/certification_page.php?sid=6\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_7\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20251205_Aquasky%20ACS%20p1.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"ACS法國飲用水容器認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/acs_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                ACS法國飲用水容器認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>ACS</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>是法國的衛生認證機構，主要基於AFNOR（法國標準化協會）公布的用於測試管道產品的標準。在法國，任何與飲用水接觸的設備或附件都必須經過ACS認證。</span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/certification_page.php?sid=7\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_8\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/Under%20Process.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"WRAS英國飲用水容器認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/wars_b.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                WRAS英國飲用水容器認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:\"><span>WRAS</span></span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>是一個推動和確保英格蘭和威爾斯的水供應（水管配件規定）以及蘇格蘭和北愛爾蘭等地的相應水規章的遵循的組織。</span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>這個批准系統還涵蓋非金屬組件和材料（如橡膠墊圈和墊片），它們經過測試以確定它們對接觸的水的影響。</span></span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_9\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20251127_WaterMark-1.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"WaterMark澳洲飲用水容器認證\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/2025-WaterMark%20LF(1).png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                WaterMark澳洲飲用水容器認證                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>WaterMark</span></span></span><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>認證是一個對管道和排水產品強制性的認證計劃。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span><span sans-serif=\"\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,\"><span><span style=\"font-family:\"><span>它確保這些產品符合澳大利亞的《澳大利亞管道代碼》，適合使用，並符合與產品品質相關的澳大利亞標準，包括健康和安全。擁有WaterMark認證標記的產品可以在整個澳大利亞範圍內使用。</span></span></span></span></span></p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"/certification_page.php?sid=9\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n                <a name=\"si_11\"></a>\n        <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding:20px 0 30px 0;\">\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-4\" style=\"padding-bottom:25px;\">\n\n            \t<div class=\"cf_img\"><img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20231030_Listing%20Category%20_%20NSF%20372%20International.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive center-block\" alt=\"NSF/ANSI 372飲用水系統認證 - 鉛含量\"></div>            </div>\n        \t<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n            \t<div>\n                <img src=\"/upfile/Images/CERTIFICATION/20231102_AQUASKY_icon_bl-NSF_large.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"img-responsive\">                </div>\n            \t<h3 class=\"cf_name\">\n                NSF/ANSI 372飲用水系統認證 - 鉛含量                </h3>\n            \t<div class=\"cf_content\">\n                <p>NSF/ANSI 372 為飲用水系統組件中，與水接觸的材料中，可能存在的鉛量設定了限制。依照此NSF/ANSI 372的標準，產品必須經過認證，以確保管道、管道配件、管道五金配件以及管道裝置與水接觸的表面，其鉛含量的加權平均應&le;0.25%。此標準將確保這些組件不會將有害的鉛含量進入到飲用水中，有助於保護公眾健康，特別是在飲用和烹飪用水的情況下。</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>                </div>\n                <div class=\"pd-btn-info-link\">\n                <a href=\"https://info.nsf.org/Certified/Lead_Content/Listings.asp?Company=12210&Standard=372-DWTU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-link\">認證連結</a>    \t\t\t</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n            </div>\n\n<div class=\"cerfitication_spacing\"></div>\n</div>"
}
